  "cross_tradition_view": "Most of these traditions would likely approve of hearing the affected player, acknowledging uncertainty, and avoiding a rushed or needlessly exclusionary decision. They may split on the final eligibility rule, because they do not provide a shared answer to how fairness applies to sex-based categories in sport, and may weigh inclusion, group commitments, and competitive fairness differently.",
